# The paths of the files that a reviewer reads before a change to them merges, because a mistake in one of them can let
# a secret out, weaken a check, or change the rules that every later change follows. scripts/loop/consequential lists
# the files of a change that match them, and scripts/hooks/pull-request-rules.check blocks a pull request that changes
# one unless it opens as a draft. Each line holds a pattern, in which * matches any characters, / too, both for
# Python's fnmatch and for bash's [[ == ]].
# The rules
AGENTS.md
*/AGENTS.md
docs/*
# The files that keep agents safe, and the files that decide what git ignores and what scripts/check runs
.claude/*
.codex/*
.github/workflows/*
scripts/*
